oroquine and chloroquine in  fact the president Bolton ro says he  keeps a box of it for his 93 year old  mother well the doctor that I spoke to  this morning he's an infectious disease  specialist says that as far as most  doctors in Brazil are concerned there's  absolutely no evidence that this is  either helpful in preventing the disease  or does anything whatsoever  when you've got the disease and this  doctor actually had coronavirus for the  best part of a month so you know Bolton  ro was an outlier there's no question  he's an anti-establishment figure when  he was asked about the record death toll  in Brazil he said so what what do you  want me to do about it he's against the  lockdown he's against social distancing  he had a rally at the weekend in which  he took photographs right beside his  supporters he hugged them he did wear a  mask which is very very unusual for him  because normally he doesn't bother and  just like President Trump in the US he  says Brazilians should get back to work  now I'm just looking out on the streets  right now German and there's quite a lot  of traffic it's not at normal levels but  Brazilians are caught between obeying  what their governors say which is stay  at home and what the president says  which is just get out there I was  speaking to the governor of são Paulo  last night and he told me there are two  viruses in Brazil the corona virus and  the Bolton ro virus and he says it's  almost criminal what the president is  doing sending out these messages so we  haven't yet reached the peak here  Dermott that will come in the next two  weeks and brazil well on course to be  not the third worst but the second worst  country in the world for coronavirus  pili lee in Shambala thank you
 

